# GDOS to an HP LaserJet: as print-easydraw, the drawing printed through
# OUTPRINT, from a copy of the disk whose device 21 is Timeworks DTP's GDOS
# LaserJet driver (HP_LJET.SYS) instead of the FX-80's, with no printer fonts
# (make_program_disks.sh). What it sends is PCL. Positions are medium
# resolution's.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/easydraw-laserjet.st
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 2500
# the first click after boot is lost: an empty spot first
mouse 400 150
click left 2
wait 25
# File > OUTPRINT..., don't save
mouse 87 5
wait 25
mouse 124 87
click left 2
wait 200
mouse 347 127
click left 2
wait 800
shot outprint
# Edit > Add Name (Alt A): DRAWINGS\HOUSE.GEM
keydown 0x38
key a
keyup 0x38
wait 150
mouse 244 105
click left 2
wait 150
key 0x01
type house.gem
key 0x1c
wait 150
shot listed
# File > Start Outprint (Ctrl P)
keydown 0x1d
key p
keyup 0x1d
wait 300
shot start
# Device: Printer (the default), OK
printwatch
mouse 455 129
click left 2
printer 1000 60000
shot printed
